# パターン編集を、デスクトップの図形編集とプロセスの図形編集で同じに使う (design 17.13),
# for tools/ui_run.py: a figure of one rectangle and two zigzag lines (mkbig fig 1 2 0)
# opened at 100,100 as 画用紙 is, パターン編集 brought up from the 塗りつぶし palette (its
# button at 123,282 to 256,304; the menu would open with what was chosen last under the
# pointer, the second time). The editor's window
# stands at 140,140, its work area from 146,168: the dots from 156,178 (12 a dot), the panel
# of parts from 362,218. The red of the swatches chosen, a dot drawn, 長方形 chosen and a
# rectangle drawn, 右回 and 復旧 and 右回 again, put into the figure with 入替, 読込 turned on
# and off, and the window closed from its menu; the figure's band pressed, and saved. The screens of the editor are the same, and
# record 0 saved after it is the same, byte for byte.
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
# the desktop's figure editor opened by open, whatever the program object says (figproc kernel)
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 1 2 0
open big
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
wait 500
click 128 48
wait 600
click 190 293
expect pattern: opened 2
wait 500
shot pcmp_k_open
click 460 256
expect pattern: colour ee0000
click 162 184
wait 200
click 492 363
expect pattern: tool 1
drag 186 208 222 244
wait 300
shot pcmp_k_drawn
click 383 489
wait 300
shot pcmp_k_turned
click 510 523
wait 300
click 383 489
wait 300
click 450 523
expect pattern: 2 put in the figure
wait 500
shot pcmp_k_put
click 380 523
expect pattern: choosing on
wait 300
shot pcmp_k_load
click 380 523
expect pattern: choosing off
wait 300
click 300 300 1
wait 600
move 302 301
wait 150
click 302 301
expect pattern: closed
wait 300
click 500 108
wait 300
sync 600
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig fig 1 2 0
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 3
wait 800
logmark
click 128 48
wait 600
click 190 293
expectsince figure: pattern: opened 2
wait 500
shot pcmp_p_open
logmark
click 460 256
expectsince figure: pattern: colour ee0000
click 162 184
wait 200
logmark
click 492 363
expectsince figure: pattern: tool 1
drag 186 208 222 244
wait 300
shot pcmp_p_drawn
click 383 489
wait 300
shot pcmp_p_turned
click 510 523
wait 300
click 383 489
wait 300
logmark
click 450 523
expectsince figure: pattern: 2 put in the figure
wait 500
shot pcmp_p_put
logmark
click 380 523
expectsince figure: pattern: choosing on
wait 300
shot pcmp_p_load
logmark
click 380 523
expectsince figure: pattern: choosing off
wait 300
logmark
click 300 300 1
wait 600
move 302 301
wait 150
click 302 301
expectsince figure: pattern: closed
wait 300
click 500 108
wait 300
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
sum show
same kernel
key 08 01
expect figure: closed
